<section class="hn hn-manager">
  <header class="hn-admin-header"><div class="editor-identity"><svg class="identity-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><path class="hn-mark-face" d="M21 7h38l14 15v37L59 73H21L7 59V22z"/><path class="hn-mark-facet" d="M59 7l14 15v37L59 73H40z"/><path class="hn-mark-core" d="M23 23h10v12h15V23h10v34H48V44H33v13H23z"/><ellipse class="hn-mark-orbit" cx="40" cy="40" rx="38" ry="13" transform="rotate(-34 40 40)"/><path class="hn-mark-cut" d="M13 18l5 -5M62 67l5 -5"/></svg><div><span class="hn-overline">HOLO<span class="hn-accent">NEWS</span> / MESTRE</span><h1>Suas notícias</h1><p>Escreva o mundo. Publique quando estiver pronto.</p></div></div><div class="hn-header-actions"><button type="button" data-appearance>Configurações</button><button type="button" data-action="portal">Abrir portal ↗</button><button type="button" class="hn-primary" data-action="create">+ Nova notícia</button></div></header>
  <div class="hn-manager-tools"><form data-manager-search class="hn-search" role="search"><label class="hn-sr" for="hn-manager-query">Buscar suas notícias</label><input id="hn-manager-query" name="query" type="search" value="{{query}}" placeholder="Buscar título, autor ou categoria"><button type="submit" aria-label="Buscar">⌕</button></form><label class="hn-filter">Mostrar<select name="filter" data-filter><option value="all" {{hnSelected filter "all"}}>Todas</option><option value="draft" {{hnSelected filter "draft"}}>Rascunhos</option><option value="published" {{hnSelected filter "published"}}>Publicadas</option><option value="revision" {{hnSelected filter "revision"}}>Revisões em rascunho</option><option value="pending" {{hnSelected filter "pending"}}>Sincronização pendente</option></select></label><span class="hn-count">{{publishedCount}} no portal · {{draftCount}} rascunho(s)</span></div>
  {{#if legacy}}<div class="hn-notice"><div><strong>Encontramos notícias da versão anterior.</strong><p>Trazer como rascunhos preserva as matérias e cria um backup completo das edições antigas.</p></div><button type="button" data-action="migrate">Trazer notícias antigas</button></div>{{/if}}
  <div class="hn-manager-list">{{#if empty}}<div class="hn-empty"><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><h2>Espaço para a próxima história</h2><p>Crie uma notícia ou ajuste os filtros para encontrar uma existente.</p><button type="button" class="hn-primary" data-action="create">+ Nova notícia</button></div>{{/if}}{{#each items}}<article class="hn-manager-row" data-tone="{{tone}}"><button type="button" class="hn-row-main" data-edit="{{id}}">{{#if cover}}<img src="{{cover}}" alt="" loading="lazy">{{else}}<span class="hn-row-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">HN</span>{{/if}}<span><span class="hn-row-category">{{category}}</span><strong>{{title}}</strong><small>{{date}}{{#if date}} · {{/if}}{{views}} visualizações</small></span></button><span class="hn-status {{#if published}}hn-status-live{{/if}} {{#if pending}}hn-status-pending{{/if}}">{{status}}</span><div class="hn-row-actions"><button type="button" data-edit="{{id}}" aria-label="Editar: {{title}}">Editar</button><button type="button" data-duplicate="{{id}}" aria-label="Duplicar: {{title}}">Duplicar</button>{{#if pending}}<button type="button" data-retry="{{id}}">Tentar sincronizar</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" class="hn-danger" data-delete="{{id}}" aria-label="Excluir: {{title}}">Excluir</button></div></article>{{/each}}</div>
  <footer class="hn-admin-footer"><span>{{total}} notícia(s) · Rascunhos exclusivos do mestre</span><div><button type="button" data-action="export">Exportar backup</button><button type="button" data-action="import">Importar backup</button><input type="file" data-import-file accept=".json,application/json" hidden></div></footer>
</section>

